E AX3024 400-macro-size-limit.ax:5:85-86 macro-expansion-limit "macro expansion produced more than the limit of 2000000 forms" !"the parser's own nesting limit measures the SOURCE, and this limit measures what expansion produced from it" ?"expansion is a rewrite, so the program the compiler sees is the expanded one; make the macro produce less, or write the repeated part as a function and let the macro expand to a call" &400-macro-size-limit.ax:1:9-10:"m"
